yurt-firefox

This repository carries a patch queue against Mozilla Firefox
(https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox) and the scripts that apply,
verify, export and build it. Firefox and the files the patches change are
licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE); patches that touch
MPL files keep those files' licence headers.

The queue also adds third-party files that are not under the MPL. Their
licence texts are added by the same patch, next to the files:

  third_party/weval   weval.h, the weval partial-evaluator interface
                      (https://github.com/bytecodealliance/weval)
                      Licence: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
                      Text: third_party/weval/LICENSE
                      Added by: patches/0004-Vendor-the-weval-and-wizer-headers.patch

  third_party/wizer   wizer.h, the Wizer pre-initialisation interface
                      (https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wizer)
                      Licence: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
                      Text: third_party/wizer/LICENSE
                      Added by: patches/0004-Vendor-the-weval-and-wizer-headers.patch

data/ics/ is the SpiderMonkey ahead-of-time IC corpus copied from
YurtOS/firefox js/src/ics: generated CacheIR stub descriptions plus Firefox's
two MPL-2.0 helper scripts (remove-duplicates.py,
remove-platform-dependent-ics.py).
